SIR 10 TDI (2BF) SMASK (3FF);
SDR 36 TDI (00000000E) SMASK (FFFFFFFFF) TDO (ABCD00024) MASK (FFFFFFFFE);  // [14/15] RDBUFF TDO ?= 0xABCD0002 (+ACK=OK)
//   ... 93% complete (14/15 commands)
SIR 10 TDI (2FF) SMASK (3FF);
SDR 36 TDI (00001A084) SMASK (FFFFFFFFF);  // [15/15] TAR ← 0x00001A08
SIR 10 TDI (2FF) SMASK (3FF);
